  <prompt>Build CreateInvoiceWizard (wrapping CreateRecordWizard) + invoiceService, following the canonical workAssignmentService.ts. Steps: Associate To → Add Files → Enter Info → Next Steps. Associate via applyResolverFields; dual-bind documents; cards Send Email / Add To Do / Assign Work; wire the invoice registry key.</prompt>
  <role>SPAARKE shared-UI developer + ADR-024. Copy the canonical service pattern exactly.</role>
  <goal>"+" on an Invoice-bound visual creates a valid sprk_invoice regarding the host via applyResolverFields; Enter Info collects the owner manifest fields; uploaded docs dual-bind to host + Invoice; useAiPrefill wired but inert (prefillEnabled=false).</goal>

  <context>
    <background>design §5.4/§5.6/§5.7/§5.8; FR-10/12/16. Invoice is resolver-ready (owner-confirmed). Manifest: sprk_invoicenumber, sprk_name, sprk_description, sprk_vendororg→sprk_organization, sprk_invoicedate (default today). Follow workAssignmentService.ts: nav-prop discovery → payload → BU defaults → applyResolverFields → createRecord → file pipeline → warnings.</background>
    <relevant-files>
      src/client/shared/Spaarke.UI.Components/src/components/CreateInvoiceWizard/ (new)
